TEXT 392 -184 Left 2 ;The Epoly can also be used (just uncomment the\nSPICE directives below), but they will be replaced\nby their behavioural counterparts by LTspice when\nflattening the netlist. This can be verified by checking\nthe expanded netlist for E2 and E3 (either check the\noption in the Control Panel > Operation > Check\nExpanded Listing, or uncomment .opt list.
